      "writtenOn": "2022-09-28T13:42:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added the assert because if you have a debug build and skia_enable_optimize_size, the compile and link flags are not set at all.\nhttps://github.com/google/skia/blob/2d45cb9b66f1b4241226e8bce9333de283a2be5d/gn/BUILDCONFIG.gn#L182-L187\n\nI think it is error prone to let both of those be set, mainly because is_debug is true by default. I forgot this and was puzzled why -Oz was not being set.\n\nIf a dev does need a debug build with the macro, then they can set is_debug\u003dtrue and set the macro in defines (or extra_cflags) as they set up their GN args.",
